WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:05.180
The winners of the 2nd round of 
the Junior Youth Championship

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.730
will face off in a battle royal.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.920
Action!

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.160
Duel!

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:23.910
The players can't duel until they acquire 
two Pendulum Cards hidden in the city.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:27.820
They'll wager them in duels, 
and the winner gets the cards.

00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.940
In the end, they'll be ranked 
by how many cards they have.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.950
Syun Kurosaki didn't show up.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.920
But he's one of the sixteen contestants.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.880
He'll definitely show up.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.200
Let's split up and search.

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.400
Yuzu?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.160
What?

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.460
Be careful.

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.110
Yeah.  You too, Yuya.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.470
Let's get the stage ready for the players!

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:57.940
Action Field on!

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.870
I activate the Field 
Spell Quartet of Quandry!

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:17.950
Volcano!

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.220
Iceberg!

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.970
Jungle!

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.600
Ancient ruins!

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:30.620
With these four areas, we're ready to go!

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:33.150
The time limit is tomorrow at noon.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.700
Who will get the glory?

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:42.880
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:48.080
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.120
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.360
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:58.110
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:00.780
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.580
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:14.700
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:20.170
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:25.770
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.910
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.850
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.180
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:43.460
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.890
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:51.900
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:58.970
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:09.480
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.190
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.890
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.680
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.430
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:29.920
Battle Royal Begins

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.170
Good.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.730
Now you have two cards.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.350
We're from Ryozanpaku School, 
and we're your opponent.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:44.900
We'll make you taste humiliation.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:47.170
Ryozanpaku...

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.010
A two-on-one duel?

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:59.580
The first duel is about to 
start in the Volcano Area!

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:06.170
It's Ryozanpaku School's Takeda and Umesugi 
versus You Show School's Yuya Sakaki!

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.840
Yuya...

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.950
His opponents are from Ryozanpaku School.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:15.420
This is the thrill of a battle royal!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:18.970
Due to the ante rule, let's 
wager our Pendulum Cards!

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.970
One each!

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:21.970
Fine!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.370
Duel!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:28.400
They each wager one Pendulum 
Card for their duel.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:29.910
President.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.860
What's the situation?

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:36.150
Yuya Sakaki and Ryozanpaku 
School's duel has just started.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:42.860
Which will win: entertainment 
or martial arts?

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:59.770
Even if Ryozanpaku School is my opponent, 
I'll duel the way I believe in!

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:03.350
I summon Performapal Skeeter 
Skimmer from my hand!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.060
Bring it on.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:09.020
We'll quickly drag you down.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:11.240
Into the darkness known as defeat!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.350
Darkness...

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:16.160
You will fall into the darkness.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:21.840
You thoroughly pummeled Kachidoki.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.170
That is your true nature.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.540
You're wrong!

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:31.680
I didn't know what I was doing back then.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:36.950
But I'll never duel like that again!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:40.600
I set one card and end my turn!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:50.750
All right!  Now I have two Pendulum Cards.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:52.560
Who is it?

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.660
Wait!

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:03.970
My turn!

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:09.680
Your special Pendulum doesn't 
only belongs to you anymore.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:18.080
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 5 
Pendulumstatue Purple Shield and Scale 11 Purple Sword!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:22.830
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 6 and 10 simultaneously!

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:24.790
Pendulum Summon!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:29.200
Come out, Tsumuji the Earthwind Star!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:34.400
Arashi the Skywind Star!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:42.060
Whoa!  Takeda already Pendulum Summoned!

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:45.650
He summoned two high Level 
monsters simultaneously!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.890
Purple Sword's Pendulum effect activates!

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:56.350
Once per turn, Warrior-Type monsters 
on my field gain 200 attack points!

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:06.000
Let's battle!  Tsumuji 
attacks Skeeter Skimmer!

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.770
I activate Skeeter Skimmer's effect!

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:14.240
By switching this card to defense 
position, it negates the battle!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.510
But I have more than one monster!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:28.220
I'll use that Action Card.

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:44.220
How horrible!

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:45.860
They're cheaters!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.800
It's frustrating, but 
their teamwork is perfect.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:53.020
I activate the Action Spell Flame Ball!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.020
Nice, Umesugi!

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:03.550
Leave it to me, Takeda!

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:06.630
They play rough.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.880
But that's not enough to defeat me!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.880
I'm not done.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:11.950
What?

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:16.540
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:21.410
Whoa!  After the battle, he's 
fusing after Pendulum Summoning?

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:24.880
I fuse Tsumuji and Arashi!

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:28.920
Wind, blow!  Tempest, run wild!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:32.350
The surging god of destruction descends!

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.820
Fusion Summon!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.830
Come, Level 10 Fujin the Breakstorm Star!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.030
I activate Fujin's effect!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:47.470
Every time the turn ends, you 
take 500 points of damage

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:50.270
for every Warrior-Type monster on the field!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.510
What?

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.980
I end my turn!

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.530
Their turn is also next.

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.440
I really need to get an Action Card!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.160
I'm counting on you, Takeda!

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:09.910
Leave it to me, Umesugi!

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:11.590
I won't let you get away!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.910
They're after me again!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.420
I'm getting cold just watching.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.300
I'm hot.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:26.400
I'm hot after running around.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:29.510
It's as hot as my country.

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.460
You're Yuzu Hiiragi!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.960
I'm Halil from LDS Anatolia!

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.880
An exchange student in the Fusion Course!

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.440
Nice to meet you!

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.220
Nice to meet you.

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:49.460
You're the Fusion user who defeated Masumi.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:51.400
I want to duel you!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:55.950
That's fine, but I don't have 
a second Pendulum Card yet.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.860
I ran around and picked up three!

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:04.880
If I give you one, we can duel 
because we'll both have two cards!

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:07.580
Thank you.  You're nice.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.320
But I won't lose the duel.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:12.480
We'll see about that.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:15.020
I'm no ordinary Fusion user.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.460
I'm an entertainment duelist 
that can use Fusion!

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:22.560
That means I'll learn a lot!

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.220
Uh, yeah.

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:29.420
New developments in the Iceberg Area!

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.740
I'll wager this Pendulum Card!

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:35.630
A duel between You Show School's Yuzu Hiiragi

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:40.110
and LDS exchange student 
Halil is about to begin!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.770
Duel!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.750
Get fired up, Yuzu!  Get your blood boiling!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:51.290
Watching two duels simultaneously 
makes me shiver twice as hard!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.770
But Yuya is...

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.340
My turn!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.880
I'll also Pendulum!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:00.600
What?

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:08.530
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 5 
Purple Shield and Scale 11 Purple Sword!

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:13.010
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 6 and 10 simultaneously!

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:14.980
Pendulum Summon!

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:19.740
Come out, Todoroki the Earthbolt Star!

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:23.290
Senko the Skybolt Star!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:29.400
Umesugi has also successfully 
Pendulum Summoned!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:33.840
And this other duel is about to begin!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.880
My turn!

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:39.770
I summon La Jinn the 
Mystical Genie of the Lamp!

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:48.550
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:51.370
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:53.020
I drew it!  Now I can...

00:11:55.100 --> 00:12:02.920
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 3 
White Butterfly and Scale 9 White Flower!

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.930
What?  Pendulum Summon?

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:09.240
It's finally time for my Pendulum debut!

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:14.210
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Absorbing Lamp.

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:20.610
It negates your spell card's 
activation and adds it to my hand.

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:21.370
What?

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.640
Please give me your White Flower.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:31.200
My first-ever Pendulum failed.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:38.120
When a Pendulum Card activates, 
it's treated as a spell card.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.400
My studying paid off!

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:45.460
I summon Opera the Melodious 
Diva from my hand!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:54.150
This card can't attack on the turn that 
it's summoned or Special Summoned.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.080
I end my turn.

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:04.970
This place is similar to my 
homeland, so I like it here.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:08.060
I don't feel like I'll lose to anyone here.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:12.270
Every year on New Year's Day, 
I train at a snowy mountain.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.960
I'm Olga of LDS Nordic School.

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:19.240
I'm an exchange student 
in the Synchro Course.

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:23.950
A new duel is about to 
begin in the Iceberg Area.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:29.220
And what about the other 
duel in the Iceberg Area?

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:32.020
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.840
A Pendulum Card!

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.790
Don't tell me the card that you drew!

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:40.030
I accidentally said it 
aloud because I was happy.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:44.300
I'm nervous.  The time has finally come.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.550
Here I go!

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:54.840
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 
1 Red Fiend and Scale 9 White Flower!

00:13:58.220 --> 00:13:59.180
What?

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.880
Hey!  Come on!

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:03.950
Huh?  Why?

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:09.860
Eeven though I want to make it popular in 
my country, entertainment dueling is hard.

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.710
Hey!  You guys!  Hey!

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:15.620
Oh!  Oh!  Yeah!  Oh!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.830
Towards the edge.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:20.350
What?

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:25.020
You have to put the Pendulum Cards in the 
Pendulum Zones that are towards the edges!

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:29.780
Place them more towards the edges?

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.160
I'm learning a lot!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.020
I've paid you back for giving me a card.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:43.720
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 8 simultaneously!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.690
Pendulum Summon!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.660
Appear, Red Lamp!

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:50.750
Purple Lamp!

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:55.620
Whoopee!  I was able to Pendulum Summon!

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.500
It's entertainment!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.570
Red Lamp's effect activates!

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:07.550
When this card is Special Summoned, 
you take 600 points of damage!

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.040
Yes!  I'm learning a lot!

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.930
That's nice...

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:18.510
I also activate Purple Lamp's effect!

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:21.420
When this card is Special Summoned,

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:25.200
I can add the spell card Polymerization 
from my deck to my hand!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.450
I activate Polymerization!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:28.970
Polymerization?

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:34.110
I fuse La Jinn the Mystical 
Genie of the Lamp and Red Lamp!

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:41.310
The spirit called from the darkness, 
be reborn carrying a soul of flames!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.070
Fusion Summon!

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:49.990
Please show up, Fire Jinn 
the Flame Genie of the Lamp!

00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:57.960
Whoa!  He also successfully 
did Pendulum Fusion!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.570
Fire Jinn's effect!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:15.020
When this card is Special Summoned, 
you take 600 points of damage!

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:21.230
Due to Red Fiend's Pendulum effect,

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:27.060
Fire Attribute monsters on my 
field gain 300 attack points!

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:29.160
This is bad!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:30.860
Let's battle!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.830
Fire Jinn attacks Opera the Melodious Diva!

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:43.200
Ouch!

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:49.920
Then Purple Lamp attacks you directly!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.280
An Action Card!

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.460
I got it!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.670
My god!  Wait up!

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.940
Yuzu!

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.750
Where's an Action Card?

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.880
Purple Sword's Pendulum effect activates!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:28.750
Once per turn, Warrior-Type monsters 
on my field gain 200 attack points!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:30.800
Let's battle!

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:33.860
Todoroki attacks Yuya Sakaki directly!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:56.550
What happened to dueling 
the way you believe in?

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:58.970
Take this!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.150
The Action Spell Flame Ball!

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:06.730
You take 200 points of damage!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:13.100
Senko attacks you directly!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:19.100
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Performapal Pinch Helper!

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:24.080
Your monster's direct attack is negated!

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:28.160
Then I Special Summon a 
Performapal in my deck

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:31.300
with 800 or fewer attack points 
by negating its effects!

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:34.090
Come, Thunderhino!

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:40.080
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell Frontline Fusion!

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:44.220
I fuse Senko and Todoroki together!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.250
Fusion during battle?

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:50.570
Shine to the heavens!  Quake the land!

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:53.440
The destruction god of thunder descends!

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:55.410
Fusion Summon!

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:59.680
Come out, Raijin the Breakbolt Star!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:04.660
When this card attacks a monster in defense 
position, it deals piercing damage!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:08.850
And this monster summoned 
during battle can attack!

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.100
It's 1200 points of piercing damage!

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:13.420
Yuya has 800 life points!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.330
That means it's over!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:20.870
Battle!  Raijin attacks Thunderhino!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:26.570
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Pinch Helper's other effect!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:32.880
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
damage from a monster battle is halved!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.330
I end my turn.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.710
My turn.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:02.790
Ouch...

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.170
Yuzu?

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.860
Gongenzaka?

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:06.710
Hey!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.310
What's with you?

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.370
Get off of me or I'll make you pay!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.800
I'm sorry!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.500
Battle Royal Mode.  Joining.

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.190
Tag Duel.

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:19.360
What?

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.930
Tag duel?

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.900
Excuse me.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.910
What's the meaning of this?

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:34.370
Two separate duels have crossed 
paths in the Iceberg Area.

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.370
There it is!

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:42.310
There will be a tag duel between the 
Hiiragi-Gongenzaka team and the Halil-Olga team!

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:45.110
Yuzu and Gongenzaka formed a tag team?

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.330
This development gives me shivers!

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:52.660
We finally found you, Syun Kurosaki.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:55.230
We'll make you pay for Shalulu.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:58.000
You'll turn into rust on our swords.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:59.260
I see.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:01.330
Knight of Duels.

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:03.910
You want revenge for your member.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:27.320
There's nothing you can do.  It's over.

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:30.060
We'll throw you into the depths of darkness.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:34.030
I won't lose.  I refuse to lose!

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:36.000
It's pointless to resist.

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:42.520
When this turn ends, Fujin's effect 
will deal you 1000 points of damage!

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.880
I end my turn!

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:01.950
Stop hogging the spotlight.

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:07.780
Let me join.

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:35.800
As long as there's a smile

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.580
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:47.880
I always believe

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:51.400
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:57.030
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.300 --> 00:23:05.670
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.670 --> 00:23:12.540
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.710 --> 00:23:19.210
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:23.280
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:56.000
Dennis arrived and erased the effect damage.

00:23:56.260 --> 00:23:58.570
You saved me?

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:04.250
But Ryozanpaku School's attacks keep coming, 
and I don't have many life points left.

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:07.550
Okay, here I go!  The Action Spell-

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:09.250
Dennis?

00:24:09.250 --> 00:24:10.970
I'm in the middle of a duel!

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:13.420
C'mon!

00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:18.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Dennis the Magnificent Exchange Student

00:24:18.400 --> 00:24:20.570
The fun is only getting started!
